{
    "info": {
        "name": "SHE Sasa - Backend API (Phase 13: Auth Sungguhan)",
        "description": "Sejak Phase 13, X-Dev-User TIDAK ADA LAGI (server/middleware/dev-auth.js dihapus). Identitas didapat lewat login sungguhan (bcrypt + cookie session HttpOnly) -- jalankan request 'Login sebagai <role>' di awal setiap folder (atau setiap kali butuh ganti role), lalu Postman otomatis membawa cookie sesi di request-request berikutnya (satu cookie jar per domain -- login sebagai role baru akan MENGGANTI sesi yang aktif, seperti login ulang di tab browser yang sama). Setiap request POST/PUT/DELETE WAJIB header X-CSRF-Token, diisi otomatis dari variable {{csrfToken}} yang di-set oleh test script tiap request login. Jalankan server dulu: npm run server (port 3001), lalu import environment 'SHE Sasa - Local (Phase 12)'.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "variable": [
        { "key": "csrfToken", "value": "" },
        { "key": "inspectionId", "value": "" },
        { "key": "scheduleId", "value": "" }
    ],
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "00 - Login & Access Control",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "GET tanpa login -> 401",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [],
                        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/inspections", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["inspections"] }
                    },
                    "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
                        "pm.test('status 401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                    ] } }]
                },
                {
                    "name": "POST /auth/login username tidak dikenal -> 401",
                    "request": {
